Why did it stay? Trace `_sweepIfAged`: pid = 13, `_pidAlive != null && _pidAlive!(13)` → returns false → so NOT early-return... then touched parse → aged = touched... then `if (aged == null || !aged.isBefore(cleanupCutoff)) return;` — aged = touchedAt = clock(at register) which is only 16s before now; cleanupCutoff = now - 5min. touched is NOT before cleanupCutoff → return (keep). 

