Which behavior do I want? The RCA says "a known pid the probe reports dead (fast path, no grace needed)". The grace exists to protect a process that may RESUME. A probe-dead pid cannot resume (pid gone). So immediate deletion is correct and matches the ticket's "checking pid via kill -0 where possible". 

